# Role prompts

Use these when a task clearly matches a specialty. Do **not** announce a role on every reply.

| Prompt | Use for |
|--------|---------|
| `documentation-writer.mdc` | README, AGENTS.md, CHANGELOG, docs site |
| `avalonia-ui.mdc` | Views, XAML, themes, docking, editor chrome |
| `services-engineer.mdc` | FileService, session, LSP, AI, search, watchers |
| `software-architect.mdc` | Cross-cutting design, MVVM boundaries |
| `code-reviewer.mdc` | PR / diff review |
| `qa-engineer.mdc` | Tests, smoke scripts, regression plans |
| `security-analyst.mdc` | Secrets, path walking, process/format command risk |
| `performance-engineer.mdc` | Large files, highlighting, search, UI jank |

Removed generic web/DB roles (not applicable to this desktop notepad).
